Package: polder-compositor
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xwayland, libgl1-mesa-dri, libegl-mesa0
Description: Polder Wayland compositor and effects renderer
 Provides polder-comp, polder-comp-fx, polder-toplevels and the compositor
 launcher. The pinned SceneFX library is private to this package; both
 renderers use Debian's wlroots and graphics libraries.

Package: polder-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, polder-compositor (= ${binary:Version}), python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-dbus, python3-xlib, python3-requests, python3-pil, python3-icalendar, python3-recurring-ical-events, python3-pampy, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-rsvg-2.0, gir1.2-packagekitglib-1.0, gir1.2-appstream-1.0, gir1.2-flatpak-1.0, gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1, libgtk-layer-shell0, gir1.2-gtksessionlock-0.1, libgtk-session-lock0, lightdm, gir1.2-lightdm-1, dbus-user-session, dbus-x11, xserver-xorg, xinit, x11-utils, x11-xserver-utils, x11-xkb-utils, xauth, libpam-systemd, xfwm4, xfce4-settings, xfconf, tint2, rofi, thunar, xfce4-terminal, picom, feh, lxpolkit, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, pulseaudio-utils, brightnessctl, foot, swayidle, swaylock, wl-clipboard, wtype, grim, wf-recorder, slurp, wlr-randr, xsettingsd, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dconf-gsettings-backend, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, packagekit, packagekit-tools, flatpak, unattended-upgrades, network-manager, bluez, udisks2, gvfs, pkexec, polkitd, xdg-user-dirs, xdg-utils, xclip, wmctrl, xdotool, imagemagick, librsvg2-bin, ffmpeg, libnotify-bin, fonts-roboto, fonts-noto-color-emoji, papirus-icon-theme, arc-theme, chromium, chromium-l10n, libsecret-tools, gnome-keyring, libpam-gnome-keyring
Recommends: polder-settings (= ${binary:Version}), kdeconnect, git, gh, python3-cryptography, age, openssh-client, mpv, mpv-mpris
Description: Polder desktop sessions and shared shell configuration
 Installs X11 and Wayland sessions, the shell, shared Python modules,
 application assets and the desktop's integration policies.
 All desktop and settings files are upgraded together to refresh each
 user's generated configuration on the next login.

Package: polder-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, polder-desktop (= ${binary:Version}), python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Description: Polder desktop settings application
 Provides the Polder settings UI. Shared settings, notifications,
 calendar, weather and web application modules belong to polder-desktop.

Package: polder-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
XB-X-Polder-Test-Key: ${polder:TestKey}
Description: Public archive signing key and Polder APT source
 Contains only the public Polder archive signing key, and a Deb822 APT
 source bound to that key with Signed-By. Debian mirrors stay configured.
